WEBVTT

00:00:01.981 --> 00:00:05.781
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.218 --> 00:00:10.052
Todoke Message

00:00:10.456 --> 00:00:19.387
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:20.666
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.666 --> 00:00:28.708
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:29.037
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.241 --> 00:00:36.443
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.816 --> 00:00:40.946
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.053 --> 00:00:45.046
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.357 --> 00:00:49.453
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.628 --> 00:00:53.029
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.365 --> 00:00:57.358
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:01.436
Todoke Message

00:01:01.841 --> 00:01:10.010
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.449 --> 00:01:14.385
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.787 --> 00:01:18.587
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.058 --> 00:01:28.490
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:32.671 --> 00:01:35.139
About the season when the
leaves fall from the treetops...

00:01:35.641 --> 00:01:38.303
...and the freezing winds
chill the cheeks...

00:01:39.678 --> 00:01:40.645
...Shurei and her companions...

00:01:40.713 --> 00:01:43.841
...were headed to Kiyo to
attend the palace celebration.

00:01:45.951 --> 00:01:47.077
All right, we'll be going.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:51.056
You know, it's so like you to go to
Kiyo for business on your honeymoon.

00:01:51.123 --> 00:01:52.488
It makes me laugh.

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:56.890
I don't mind at all, dear husband.

00:01:57.663 --> 00:02:00.530
Oh, congratulations
on your marriage.

00:02:01.433 --> 00:02:04.300
I didn't even know
you two were engaged.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.739
It's a relief that you
two are finally together.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.240
For you to take my
elder sister as a bride.

00:02:10.309 --> 00:02:13.938
Yushun, you may very well be the
most amazing man in Sa Province.

00:02:14.914 --> 00:02:17.508
W-Well, shall we be on our way?

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:18.917
Ah, yes!

00:02:20.986 --> 00:02:22.613
Everyone, take care.

00:02:22.688 --> 00:02:25.122
We'll be sure to protect
things here while you're away.

00:02:25.424 --> 00:02:26.618
I'm counting on you!

00:02:33.999 --> 00:02:36.160
I hear that Yushun
and Miss Rin Sai...

00:02:36.235 --> 00:02:38.203
...have made their love of
over ten years bear fruit.

00:02:39.138 --> 00:02:41.606
- It's wonderful, isn't it?
- Yes.

00:02:45.444 --> 00:02:47.912
I wonder if our proposal
will bear fruit too.

00:02:49.381 --> 00:02:54.341
There is No Today After Today

00:03:04.363 --> 00:03:07.423
Oh, Your Majesty. You're here
a bit earlier than usual today.

00:03:19.945 --> 00:03:22.413
General Ran and Lord Koyu are
seemingly busy making preparations...

00:03:22.481 --> 00:03:26.713
...to welcome the new year, so they
haven't been here much lately.

00:03:28.187 --> 00:03:29.017
Shoka.

00:03:29.788 --> 00:03:30.413
Yes?

00:03:31.323 --> 00:03:33.291
Shurei is returning.

00:03:42.401 --> 00:03:45.029
I feel better now.
I'm going back to work.

00:03:46.105 --> 00:03:50.371
I can only provide you with a
break for a quick cup of tea.

00:03:50.743 --> 00:03:52.040
Shoka.

00:03:52.478 --> 00:03:52.739
Yes?

00:03:53.846 --> 00:03:56.178
Don't worry. I'm fine.

00:04:06.992 --> 00:04:10.359
Now, will we be able to get that
matter approved by the royal council?

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.963
Governor Hong. Everything
rests on your shoulders.

00:04:15.734 --> 00:04:18.066
If we're unable to convince the
officials on the royal council...

00:04:18.137 --> 00:04:20.605
...don't expect to be able
to return to Sa Province.

00:04:21.607 --> 00:04:22.938
I understand.

00:04:27.579 --> 00:04:30.480
Kiyo... Kiyo is getting closer.

00:04:31.417 --> 00:04:33.180
The whole reason for
running the horses...

00:04:33.252 --> 00:04:34.617
...was to get there faster, Mr. Kokujun.

00:04:35.187 --> 00:04:40.090
If only I was as manly as you,
Miss Rin. Mr. Ensei was telling me.

00:04:41.026 --> 00:04:43.620
He says if you ask young
girls who's the strongest...

00:04:43.696 --> 00:04:45.323
...coolest person in Sa Province...

00:04:46.131 --> 00:04:48.691
...Miss Rin Sai would get the
most votes in a landslide.

00:04:51.337 --> 00:04:53.396
Anyways, we'll enter Kiyo soon.

00:05:04.783 --> 00:05:06.751
We've returned.

00:05:06.952 --> 00:05:08.249
To the spiritual center of dreams...

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.412
...guarded by the Eight Colored
Enlightened Ones.

00:05:10.155 --> 00:05:12.817
But right now, my dream
lies in Sa Province.

00:05:29.008 --> 00:05:30.669
Ouch!

00:05:30.743 --> 00:05:35.077
Well... now... first, I make
some tea. Um... right...

00:05:35.814 --> 00:05:37.907
And they'll probably be hungry!

00:05:46.492 --> 00:05:48.653
Sh-Shurei. Ah, welcome ho...

00:06:07.079 --> 00:06:09.070
Please be on your way.

00:06:09.748 --> 00:06:11.375
You have the expression
of a government official.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.315
You have work to do, don't you?

00:06:16.789 --> 00:06:19.451
I'll do my best. Then after that,
I'll say, "I'm home!"

00:06:21.126 --> 00:06:23.560
Welcome home, Seiran.
I'm pleased to see you back.

00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:29.300
I'm sorry to have made you wait.

00:06:29.735 --> 00:06:30.997
Are you fine with just that?

00:06:31.403 --> 00:06:33.928
You just saw your father for
the first time in a while.

00:06:35.641 --> 00:06:38.508
Yes. But father told
me to be on my way.

00:06:39.378 --> 00:06:41.846
He said that, right now, I have the
expression of a government official.

00:06:42.881 --> 00:06:44.849
He's a good father.

00:06:45.417 --> 00:06:47.385
What will you do next,
Miss Rin Sai?

00:06:47.853 --> 00:06:49.684
I'll pay a visit to the Hong Clan's
main branch residence at once...

00:06:49.755 --> 00:06:52.485
...and begin negotiations for the rights
to the luminous seven colored paint.

00:06:52.958 --> 00:06:57.395
I'll be counting on you for the funds that
will allow that plan to be established.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:02.999
If this paint can be manufactured in Sa,
it will lead to significant profits.

00:07:04.336 --> 00:07:07.169
The negotiations will likely proceed
smoothly, without any problems.

00:07:08.107 --> 00:07:10.575
We have a firm promise
from the Hong Clan...

00:07:10.642 --> 00:07:13.110
...that the Merchants Guild
of Sa Province will acquire...

00:07:13.178 --> 00:07:15.646
...the production method and
derivative rights for the paint.

00:07:17.449 --> 00:07:19.417
All that remains is
the palace celebration.

00:07:21.653 --> 00:07:25.384
We've finally arrived!
What should I do?

00:07:26.325 --> 00:07:28.623
Just be prepared for whatever
comes of this, already!

00:07:37.069 --> 00:07:39.867
- Well, Kokujun. Good luck.
- What?!

00:07:40.439 --> 00:07:42.907
Since the official palace celebration
is only open to representatives...

00:07:42.975 --> 00:07:45.443
...of the Seven Color Clans and high
officials from the royal council...

00:07:46.078 --> 00:07:48.546
...we'll be greeting His
Majesty after the ceremony.

00:07:49.515 --> 00:07:51.983
- Then... I-I'll be going there alone?
- Yes.

00:07:52.718 --> 00:07:55.710
Please go in and properly extend your
greetings, as head of the Sa Clan.

00:08:17.676 --> 00:08:22.477
They all seem like such important
people. I wanna go home already.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.718
- Kokujun.
- What? Uh...!

00:08:29.721 --> 00:08:32.019
- Ryuren!
- Did he say "Ryuren"?

00:08:32.424 --> 00:08:34.654
- That genius from the Ran Clan?
- Oh, there he is!

00:08:34.726 --> 00:08:36.523
- That's him!
- That's Ryuren Ran!

00:08:36.595 --> 00:08:38.825
Boy am I glad to see
you here, Ryuren!

00:08:39.331 --> 00:08:42.425
- Who's he?
- Ryuren Ran just called out to him.

00:08:44.636 --> 00:08:46.604
Well, Kokujun Sa.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.678
- This way.
- Y-Yes.

00:08:57.416 --> 00:09:00.078
I am Reishin Hong,
head of the Hong Clan.

00:09:01.853 --> 00:09:04.219
I would like to take this opportunity
to extend my congratulations...

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:07.058
...on your appointment as
head of the Sa Clan.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.392
So that man is the new
head of the Sa Clan?

00:09:10.462 --> 00:09:13.022
Reishin Hong congratulated
him on his appointment.

00:09:16.802 --> 00:09:18.565
Please excuse me.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.839
Accompanied by the head of
the Hong Clan and Ryuren Ran...

00:09:21.907 --> 00:09:23.568
...Kokujun Sa made his
appearance at the...

00:09:23.642 --> 00:09:25.269
...palace celebration
without incident.

00:09:26.411 --> 00:09:28.572
There's a buzz through
the royal council...

00:09:29.047 --> 00:09:31.015
...that we could be
witnessing the birth of a young...

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:34.319
...shrewd clan leader, who could
surpass the former head, Enjun Sa.

00:09:35.787 --> 00:09:37.755
In any event,
it appears that Kokujun...

00:09:37.823 --> 00:09:40.724
...has lured in important allies
from both the Hong and Ran Clans.

00:09:43.996 --> 00:09:47.932
Is the important person from
the Hong Clan Uncle Kuro?

00:09:51.737 --> 00:09:54.865
My intention was to wait until the
palace celebration was over, but...!

00:09:55.407 --> 00:09:59.434
Well, I didn't think I'd have
the free time while here, either.

00:10:00.445 --> 00:10:03.073
Elder Brother is the head
of the clan, but I came too...

00:10:03.148 --> 00:10:07.141
...determined to get a glimpse
of Shurei even from a distance.

00:10:08.253 --> 00:10:10.653
So regarding the luminous
seven colored paint...!

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:15.187
I have been informed of the details
by Shurei... or rather Governor Hong.

00:10:15.994 --> 00:10:17.427
As a government official...

00:10:17.496 --> 00:10:20.954
...she plays her cards
without hesitation. Quite impressive.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.991
She did not take advantage of
the fact that she's my niece.

00:10:24.636 --> 00:10:27.469
She made her request strictly
as the Governor of Sa Province.

00:10:28.507 --> 00:10:30.498
It amazes me that
my absentminded brother...

00:10:30.575 --> 00:10:33.339
...could raise such
a competent daughter.

00:10:34.713 --> 00:10:39.047
The official palace celebration
appears to be over. It's now our turn.

00:10:40.319 --> 00:10:43.152
We are not obligated to appear before
the officials of the royal council...

00:10:43.722 --> 00:10:47.317
...but there may be many onlookers
when we make our greetings.

00:10:47.859 --> 00:10:48.826
What?

00:10:49.061 --> 00:10:50.528
It's common for
people to show up...

00:10:50.629 --> 00:10:52.460
...for the greetings of
officials they're interested in.

00:10:53.198 --> 00:10:56.258
Are we by any chance
the center of attention?

00:10:57.069 --> 00:11:00.664
Why, naturally. We did suppress
the chaos in Sa Province, after all.

00:11:03.275 --> 00:11:06.073
This is the first time that I will meet
His Majesty since he rose to the throne.

00:11:06.345 --> 00:11:08.540
I wonder how much he's changed.

00:11:09.614 --> 00:11:13.983
Mr. Yushun. You don't think too
fondly of His Majesty, do you?

00:11:14.686 --> 00:11:17.780
That's true. As far as I could
see at His Majesty's coronation...

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:21.159
...he had no motivation or desire.

00:11:21.426 --> 00:11:23.394
B-But now, he's...!

00:11:23.595 --> 00:11:27.827
I am aware. I have heard many
things about him from Ensei...

00:11:29.534 --> 00:11:32.230
...but bottom line, I must
see it with my own eyes.

00:11:33.739 --> 00:11:35.604
You're very strict.

00:11:35.674 --> 00:11:39.508
Regardless of what reason he had for
deciding to take the king's throne...

00:11:39.878 --> 00:11:42.938
...he must carry the obligations and
responsibilities that come with it.

00:11:44.483 --> 00:11:48.112
Even if that should result in
a path of eternal loneliness.

00:11:50.288 --> 00:11:52.256
A path of eternal loneliness?

00:12:00.999 --> 00:12:05.959
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:12:14.679 --> 00:12:16.647
It's finally time, Your Majesty.

00:12:18.483 --> 00:12:20.678
I wonder if Shurei will make it here.

00:12:21.319 --> 00:12:23.879
I don't think she'll get lost
on her way here like you would.

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.758
You're right. Shurei may have
gotten lost along the way...

00:12:26.825 --> 00:12:28.793
...but she found her way here.

00:12:33.465 --> 00:12:36.025
It's finally time for the greetings from
the representatives of Sa Province.

00:12:36.701 --> 00:12:37.497
Yes.

00:12:38.336 --> 00:12:40.463
But look at all the onlookers.

00:12:41.206 --> 00:12:43.674
You and I are both onlookers, too.

00:12:44.743 --> 00:12:46.711
Well, look who's here.

00:12:46.945 --> 00:12:51.405
- It looks like everyone's gathered.
- Yes. Including you, Secretary Ro.

00:12:51.917 --> 00:12:53.885
One of my few pleasures in life...

00:12:54.219 --> 00:12:58.155
...is seeing the triumphant return of
my former students with my own eyes.

00:13:00.959 --> 00:13:02.927
They've returned?

00:13:10.435 --> 00:13:12.995
Excuse... me...!

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:27.140
Secretary Ro.

00:13:27.219 --> 00:13:29.551
Oh. Have you come to see your
contemporary's hour of triumph...

00:13:29.654 --> 00:13:32.122
...after suppressing the
chaos in Sa Province?

00:13:34.059 --> 00:13:36.527
Indeed, the news of the new
governors of Sa Province...

00:13:36.595 --> 00:13:39.063
...being credited for the
appointment of Sa Clan's new head...

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.894
...as well as the mass arrest, sent
shockwaves through the royal council.

00:13:42.434 --> 00:13:44.402
But...

00:13:45.003 --> 00:13:47.767
I... I'm the only one who
wasn't surprised by the news.

00:13:48.139 --> 00:13:50.539
For those two, it's only natural that
they'd accomplish something like that!

00:13:54.779 --> 00:13:56.474
You're creepy.

00:13:56.548 --> 00:13:59.517
Shut up! As if you could understand
what I'm feeling right now!

00:14:00.519 --> 00:14:04.182
Finally. I'm finally going to
meet my adorable niece again!

00:14:05.056 --> 00:14:07.024
You're only going to
watch her from afar.

00:14:07.459 --> 00:14:10.189
I, on the other hand, shall give her
words of appreciation afterwards.

00:14:10.362 --> 00:14:12.330
Enough of your impudence!

00:14:14.699 --> 00:14:17.327
The Honorable Shurei Hong,
Governor of Sa Province...

00:14:17.636 --> 00:14:20.605
...and The Honorable Yushun Tei,
Lieutenant Governor of Sa Province...

00:14:20.772 --> 00:14:23.240
...shall now make their
entrance to the palace.

00:14:56.007 --> 00:14:58.066
She's become... beautiful.

00:15:25.203 --> 00:15:27.262
I, Shurei Hong, Governor of
Sa Province along with...

00:15:27.806 --> 00:15:31.765
...Lieutenant Governor Yushun
Tei present ourselves before you.

00:15:39.217 --> 00:15:41.185
Both of you, lift up your heads.

00:16:07.879 --> 00:16:09.847
On behalf of Sa Province...

00:16:09.914 --> 00:16:13.213
...I humbly extend our happiness
on the coming of the new year.

00:16:39.511 --> 00:16:43.811
Yushun Tei. You've supported Sa
Province well for these last ten years.

00:16:46.384 --> 00:16:48.352
We're sorry to have been so late.

00:16:54.225 --> 00:16:56.693
Governor Hong, your efforts
are also appreciated.

00:17:01.633 --> 00:17:03.601
Your Majesty!

00:17:05.003 --> 00:17:07.471
While this is a ceremony for
celebrating the new year...

00:17:08.139 --> 00:17:10.607
...there is a matter which I
would like to present to you.

00:17:11.776 --> 00:17:13.243
What is it?

00:17:13.311 --> 00:17:16.212
It is an important matter concerning
the future of Sa Province.

00:17:18.883 --> 00:17:20.510
What is she up to?

00:17:21.252 --> 00:17:23.720
Governor Hong, we were in the
middle of the palace celebration!

00:17:27.425 --> 00:17:29.893
What's the fuss?
Let's hear what she has to say.

00:17:31.663 --> 00:17:33.597
If it's concerning the
future of Sa Province...

00:17:33.665 --> 00:17:35.098
...then it must be a cheerful topic.

00:17:35.767 --> 00:17:38.759
Would that not be most suitable for
our joyous new year celebration?

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:41.238
What do you think, Your Majesty?

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:09.227
Very well, then. Lift your head
and share your proposal with us.

00:18:18.109 --> 00:18:20.236
Thank you very much. Well, then...

00:18:21.412 --> 00:18:23.607
Up until now, there has not been
an industry within Sa Province...

00:18:23.681 --> 00:18:25.808
...that would serve as a source
of revenue for the province.

00:18:25.884 --> 00:18:28.944
That is one reason why it has
been mired in unrest for so long.

00:18:29.921 --> 00:18:32.617
Although Sa Province
has welcomed a new era...

00:18:33.258 --> 00:18:36.159
...unless we aim for further
development and growth now...

00:18:36.661 --> 00:18:38.925
...the quality of life for the people will
be no more enriched than it has been.

00:18:40.398 --> 00:18:42.127
And?

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:46.034
We would like to establish a provincial
research institution in Sa Province.

00:18:48.807 --> 00:18:51.571
Be it in medicine, pharmacy,
engineering, or fine arts...

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.805
...we'd gather specialists
and researchers...

00:18:53.878 --> 00:18:55.709
...of different fields in Sa Province.

00:18:56.514 --> 00:19:00.109
And by doing so, we would initiate a
broad range of research and...

00:19:00.618 --> 00:19:04.110
...development for the good of Sa
Province's... no, not just Sa Province...

00:19:04.189 --> 00:19:06.157
...but all of Saiunkoku's future.

00:19:09.961 --> 00:19:12.429
You wish to make Sa Province
a center of academic research?

00:19:12.497 --> 00:19:13.725
Yes.

00:19:13.798 --> 00:19:15.163
Is this your personal opinion...

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:18.266
...or a proposal from the
Sa Province government?

00:19:19.037 --> 00:19:21.005
It is from the Sa Province
government.

00:19:23.975 --> 00:19:25.943
With all due respect
we have prepared...

00:19:26.177 --> 00:19:30.273
...a document which provides
the contents of our plan in detail.

00:19:31.416 --> 00:19:34.283
You'd think rescuing the province from
chaos would've taken all their effort...

00:19:35.053 --> 00:19:37.544
...but for them to also
work out a plan like this?

00:19:38.122 --> 00:19:41.421
Of course, Sa Province alone
cannot make this plan succeed.

00:19:42.427 --> 00:19:44.827
One would estimate that this would
require a vast amount of funds.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.798
With regards to funding,
we have been promised...

00:19:47.866 --> 00:19:50.391
...the full co-operation of Sa Province's
branch of the Merchants Guild.

00:19:51.169 --> 00:19:53.603
But it would be a great amount even
for the Merchants Guild to cover.

00:19:53.671 --> 00:19:55.229
Where would they get their funds?

00:19:55.306 --> 00:19:59.299
The Hong Clan will transfer the rights
to the luminous seven-colored paint.

00:20:00.712 --> 00:20:01.872
I see.

00:20:01.946 --> 00:20:04.210
Would you please kindly
conduct a review of my plan...

00:20:05.316 --> 00:20:07.682
...and discuss it during
a royal council session?

00:20:14.292 --> 00:20:16.192
I humbly beseech you.

00:20:19.631 --> 00:20:22.794
This plan will open up the future
for this country, Saiunkoku?

00:20:23.601 --> 00:20:25.068
Yes.

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:27.568
I am confident that study not
only opens the path to the future...

00:20:27.639 --> 00:20:28.663
...but builds it as well.

00:20:29.574 --> 00:20:32.907
I myself have come as far as
I have by these very means.

00:20:35.179 --> 00:20:37.579
Unless we do something,
Sa Province will have no future!

00:20:39.284 --> 00:20:43.015
I humbly ask that you kindly give
this matter your consideration!

00:20:53.131 --> 00:20:56.897
I would also like to hear more
details about this proposal!

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:00.638
Hakumei!

00:21:00.705 --> 00:21:02.172
Myself as well.

00:21:02.707 --> 00:21:03.435
Me too.

00:21:05.043 --> 00:21:06.010
Me too.

00:21:07.946 --> 00:21:09.914
Well, that goes for me too.

00:21:29.701 --> 00:21:33.102
This proposal has certainly caught
my attention. I find it very interesting.

00:21:33.805 --> 00:21:36.501
You have my word that we'll look
over and consider your plan.

00:22:17.315 --> 00:22:19.340
That was magnificent,
Governor Hong!

00:22:21.052 --> 00:22:24.021
- Are you all right?
- I'm so glad...

00:22:25.156 --> 00:22:27.147
...that the proposal
will be considered.

00:22:29.894 --> 00:22:30.861
Hey!

00:22:33.264 --> 00:22:35.960
- Good to see you back.
- Hakumei.

00:22:39.303 --> 00:22:40.270
Thank you.

00:22:43.908 --> 00:22:46.877
- Welcome back, Shu.
- Everyone...!

00:22:47.145 --> 00:22:48.942
You've still got much to learn...

00:22:49.013 --> 00:22:51.243
...but that was an impressive show of
your talents as a government official.

00:22:51.315 --> 00:22:53.613
But things will only
get tougher from now on.

00:22:53.684 --> 00:22:55.652
Right!

00:22:56.087 --> 00:23:00.353
For that young lady to think of a plan to
open up the future for an entire country.

00:23:01.692 --> 00:23:03.660
But isn't it a little rushed?

00:23:04.429 --> 00:23:06.590
There is no today after today.

00:23:07.632 --> 00:23:09.600
That girl knows that to be true.

00:23:09.867 --> 00:23:12.392
That there's always a chance
tomorrow will never come.

00:23:15.206 --> 00:23:17.174
The road ahead is still long...

00:23:17.708 --> 00:23:20.176
...but we've taken a step towards
rebuilding Sa Province.

00:23:20.645 --> 00:23:23.842
For the sake of realizing this plan
I must continue working hard at it!

00:23:30.555 --> 00:23:35.652
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:42.197
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:47.460
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.672 --> 00:23:52.769
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.778 --> 00:23:58.181
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.717 --> 00:24:04.848
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.623 --> 00:24:16.192
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.068 --> 00:24:22.665
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.074 --> 00:24:28.137
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.013 --> 00:24:34.576
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.952 --> 00:24:41.755
Kono omoi todoketekureru

